  "description_short": "Family-friendly seafood and sushi spot at Eden Meander, serving fresh fish, platters and Japanese favourites.",
  "description_long": "John Dory's George brings reliable seafood and sushi to the Eden Meander Lifestyle Centre, making it an easy stop for families exploring the Garden Route. The menu covers all the classics — grilled linefish, calamari, prawn platters, and a solid sushi selection — with a relaxed, unpretentious vibe that works whether you're grabbing a quick lunch or settling in with the kids.\n\nThe setting is straightforward mall dining, but the kitchen delivers consistent quality at prices that won't stretch the holiday budget. Portions are generous, the staff are efficient, and there's enough variety to keep everyone happy. It's the kind of place where you know what you're getting, and sometimes that's exactly what you need after a day on the road or at the beach.",
